江去官後所作、同題同事件與裴引續漢書相應；不是經書尚書自身。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:w0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"三禮解詁","kind":"work","work_id":"w-sanli-jiegu-hhs064-luzhi-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳原題；裴引續漢書作禮記解詁，異題分存未定同一作品。作者盧植由本傳作句報告，未親見原作。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"植","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:m0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"馬融","kind":"person","person_id":"ddo_1vf_io4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:w0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"禮記","kind":"work","work_id":"w-liji-hhs064-luzhi-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"盧植上書所稱經文；不當成其自作禮記解詁或三禮解詁。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:m0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:w0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"周禮","kind":"work","work_id":"w-zhouli-hhs064-luzhi-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳上書明題，古今經本及底本未核。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:w0141","start":141,"end":145,"surface":"尚書章句","kind":"work","work_id":"w-shangshu-zhangju-sgz022-luyu-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同盧植九江去官後所作、同題同事件與裴引續漢書相應；不是經書尚書自身。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p002:w0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"禮記","kind":"work","work_id":"w-liji-hhs064-luzhi-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","i